        "id": 0,
        "original_id": "e9f96bc6-af63-55b8-a938-793d61456cfd",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Dog breeds: Labrador Retriever, Tibetan Terrier, Mastador\n- Dogs: Spike, Araki Fabulous Willy\n- Roles: dog actor, Best In Show winner\n- Events: Crufts 2007, the 1957 Disney film Old Yeller\n\nFacts:\n- The Labrador Retriever, also called the Labrador, is a type of retriever-gun dog.\n- Travelers' accounts referred to the Tibetan Terrier as Dokhi Apso or \"outdoor\" Apso, indicating a shaggy or bearded working dog that lives outdoors.\n- In 1957, Spike was a lop-eared yellow Mastador, a Mastiff/Labrador Retriever mix, and a dog actor best known for playing Old Yeller in Disney's film Old Yeller with Tommy Kirk, Dorothy McGuire, Fess Parker, and Kevin Corcoran.\n- Araki Fabulous Willy, also known as Willy, was a male Tibetan Terrier born on 25 April 2001 and died on 4 December 2008.\n- In 2007, Araki Fabulous Willy won the Best In Show title at Crufts.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
      {
        "id": 1,
